WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:02.019
- [Host] Located on the steep hillsides

00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:03.109
in Chongqing, China are the

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:05.609
ancient rock carvings of Dazu.

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:09.466
(upbeat pop music)

00:00:11.719 --> 00:00:13.981
With more than 60,000 figures,

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:16.234
the Dazu carvings are one of the largest

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:17.654
and most spectacular collections

00:00:17.654 --> 00:00:21.057
of ancient sculpture work in the world.

00:00:21.057 --> 00:00:23.297
The carvings date back
to the Ninth Century,

00:00:23.297 --> 00:00:25.381
featuring imagery from Buddhism,

00:00:25.381 --> 00:00:27.465
Taoism, and Confucianism,

00:00:27.465 --> 00:00:29.125
which highlights the peaceful coexistence

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:32.493
of the three religions in ancient China.

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:34.569
In addition to the religious themes,

00:00:34.569 --> 00:00:36.101
there are statues of everyday

00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:39.517
domestic and farming life
from the same period.

00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:42.590
Aesthetically, the rock carvings
are animated in appearance,

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:44.770
and reflect traditional Chinese culture,

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.923
emphasizing learning from the past.

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:50.829
The site wasn't open to
visitors until the 1960s,

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:53.677
when Chinese nationals were given access.

00:00:53.677 --> 00:00:55.905
20 years later, the
carvings were made available

00:00:55.905 --> 00:00:57.253
to the general public,

00:00:57.253 --> 00:00:58.689
and around the turn of the century,

00:00:58.689 --> 00:01:01.814
it was declared a UNESCO
World Heritage Site.

00:01:01.814 --> 00:01:04.709
The organization cited the
statues aesthetic quality,

00:01:04.709 --> 00:01:06.602
their rich diversity of subject matter,

00:01:06.602 --> 00:01:08.725
and the light they shed on everyday life

00:01:08.725 --> 00:01:11.285
in China during this period.

00:01:11.285 --> 00:01:14.285
(gentle pop music)

